Game data is not included
-------------------------

No Quake game data ships with this repository, and none may be added to it.
The pak files, maps, models, sounds, music and QuakeC progs remain the property
of id Software / ZeniMax (Bethesda) under their own, non-GPL terms. id's own
release notes are explicit about it: "All of the Quake data files remain
copyrighted and licensed under the original terms, so you cannot redistribute
data from the original game."

To play, supply your own data:

  - The shareware episode (`pak0.pak`) may be redistributed under its own
    terms, which are not the GPL. It contains episode 1 only.
  - The registered game (`pak0.pak` + `pak1.pak`) must be purchased. It is sold
    on Steam, GOG and elsewhere.
  - The mission packs (Scourge of Armagon / `hipnotic`, Dissolution of Eternity
    / `rogue`) are also commercial data. Their QuakeC source is not part of this
    repository; the engine runs their shipped `progs.dat` as bytecode, the same
    way the original does.
  - QuakeWorld additionally needs `qw/qwprogs.dat`, which ships in id's
    QuakeWorld release.

