Bethesda Softworks.


Third-party components used at runtime
--------------------------------------

Loaded from the host system through `bun:ffi`; none is bundled or linked into
this repository:

  - SDL2 (zlib license) — window, input, audio.
  - The system OpenGL driver — used only by the `gl` renderer.
  - libvorbisfile / libvorbis / libogg (BSD-3-Clause) — optional, for the
    `music/NN.ogg` CD-track replacement.
